<div class="fcd-note fcd-note--danger">
    <span class="fcd-note__title">Restricted page</span>
    <p>This reference names configuration keys, hosts and security settings. It never shows secret values. Don't copy it anywhere public. Findings that need action are collected on <a href="/docs/system/operations#issues">Operations &amp; known issues</a>.</p>
