<section class="fcd-section" id="overview">
    <h2>The two applications</h2>
    <div class="fcd-table-wrap">
        <table class="fcd-table">
            <thead><tr><th></th><th>ForestChurches (the website)</th><th>EmailManagement (the email app)</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr><td>Repository</td><td><code>shotgn16/ForestChurches_2026</code>, branch <code>redesign/forest-floor</code></td><td><code>shotgn16/EmailManagement-ForestChurches</code>, branch <code>feature/delivery-status</code></td></tr>
                <tr><td>Type</td><td>ASP.NET Core 8 Razor Pages app with a few MVC/API controllers</td><td>ASP.NET Core 8 Web API (controllers + Swagger)</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Address</td><td><code>https://forestchurches.co.uk</code></td><td><code>https://api.forestchurches.co.uk</code></td></tr>
                <tr><td>Job</td><td>Public site, church admin, site admin, accounts, events, bulletins, ChurchSuite sync</td><td>Receives emails from the website, queues them, fills HTML templates and sends them over SMTP</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Data</td><td>MySQL/MariaDB (EF Core + Pomelo), Azure Blob Storage</td><td>In memory only (queue and status records)</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Secrets</td><td>Azure Key Vault via <code>EnvironmentCredential</code></td><td>The same Key Vault via <code>EnvironmentCredential</code></td></tr>
                <tr><td>Logging</td><td>Serilog → Grafana Loki and a MariaDB <code>applicationlogs</code> table; Elmah XML files</td><td>Serilog → daily file and Seq; Windows Event Log</td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
</section>

